    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yakupeleka pa ndaŵi ja masika",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Patimkajinjile ni kutamilicika cenene mcilambo citakampe AMBUJE",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Mlungu jwenu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ni kupanda mbeju. Patimkatande gowola mbeju ja mtundu uliwose, mbeju syandanda sitimkagowolesyo, jwalijose jwa jemanja akasiŵice mlukalala, ni akajawule nasyo ku malo gamo giŵagasagwile AMBUJE Mlungu jwenu, kuti ŵandu akamlambileje.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.23.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eks 23:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ajawule kwa jwamkulungwa jwa ŵakutaga mbopesi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " jwali pa masengo pa ndaŵi jelejo ni akamsalile kuti, ‘Sambano manyilile kuti AMBUJE Mlungu jwangu anjinjisye mcilambo, cele ciŵatesile cilanga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " kwa acinangolo ŵetu kuti tacitupa uweji.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Jwakutaga mbopesi takapocele lukalalalo, ni takalutamice pasogolo pa malo gakupelecela mbopesi, ga AMBUJE Mlungu jwenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkasale pameso pa AMBUJE Mlungu jwenu aga maloŵega, ‘Nangolo jwangu ŵaliji mundu jwakwendajenda jwa lukosyo lwa ku upande wa Siliya, ŵalijigele liŵasa lyakwe lyosope ni ŵajile kutama ku Iguputo. Pakwawula kweleko ŵaliji ŵandu ŵa mnono, nambo panyuma pakwe ŵatupile ni ŵaliji ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwamacili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵa ku Iguputo ŵatutamice mwa ngalwe ni ŵatukanganicisye kukamula masengo mpela acikapolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uweji twalisile kwa AMBUJE, Mlungu jwa acinangolo ŵetu, kuti atukamucisye. Ŵakupikene kulila kwetu, soni ŵakuweni kulaga kwetu, ŵagaweni masengo gamakulungwa giŵatukamulisyaga jemanja jila, ni ŵakumanyilile kudandawula kwetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE ŵatukopwesye ku cilambo ca Iguputo, mwamacili gawo gamakulungwa. Ŵayitesile yindu yakusimonjeka ni yimanyisyo, soni ŵayitesile yindu yejinji yakogoya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pambesi pakwe ŵatujigele mpaka akuno ni ŵatupele cilambo acino cana cajila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo sambano une, yice kwa ŵalakwe AMBUJE ni mbuwa ja yakugowola yangu yakutanda ya mcilambo cambele une.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mli m'masile kusala gele maloŵega, mkalitamice pasi lukalala pasogolo pa malo gakupelecela mbopesi ga AMBUJE Mlungu jwenu, ni mkajinamile pasi ni kwalambila AMBUJEWO. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkatogolele AMBUJE Mlungu jwenu, pakuŵa jemanja pamo ni ŵa m'maŵasa mwenu ampele yindu yambone. Mkasangalale pamo ni Alefi ni acalendo ŵamkutama nawo pasikati penu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Caka catatu cilicose mpeleceje cakupeleka ca likumi, ca yagowola yenu kwa Alefi, kwa acalendo, kwa ŵanace ŵamasije ni kwa acakongwe ŵamasije",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " kuti ku misinda jakutama ŵandu ŵeleŵa, akoleje yakulya yakwanila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.14.28+DEU.14.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Det 14:28-29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mli m'masile kupeleka yagowola yenuyo, msale kwa AMBUJE kuti, ‘Pangali cakupeleka ca likumi cisigesye m'nyumba mwangu. Mbelece yosope kwa Alefi, kwa acalendo, kwa ŵanace ŵamasije, mpela muŵandamulile kuti mbeleceje ca likumi. Nganinilinyosya kapena kuliliŵalila lilamusi lyawo lililyose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Une nganindya cindu ca likumi cilicose pinaliji mkulila malilo. Soni nginindyosya cilicose m'nyumba mwangu, pa ndaŵi jinaliji mundu jwangaŵajilwa kuŵandicila pa msyungu wa mapopelo. Nganimbeleka mbopesi, mbuwa jilijose ja yakupelekayo kwa ŵandu ŵakuwa. Une napikanile ŵalakwe AMBUJE, nayitesile yindu yosope yiŵalamulile kupeleka ya kakumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alole pasi kutyocela kwinani kutyocela ku malo gawo gamaswela gali kwinaniko, ni ŵape upile Aisalaeli ŵandu ŵawo. Acipe upile cilambo ca cajila catupeleci, mpela muŵatendele cilanga ni acinangolo ŵetu.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵakwe ŵakwepe ŵa AMBUJE",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“AMBUJE Mlungu jwenu, akumlamula lelo jino kuti mgapikanile malamusi gawo gosope, myoyo mgapikanile mwakulupicika ni mtima wenu wosope. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jemanja lelo jino mjiticisye pakwanga kuti, AMBUJE taŵe Mlungu jwenu, soni mŵisile cilanga cakwapikanila AMBUJEWO, ni kugasunga malamusi gawo gosope, ni kuyitenda yindu yosope yakumlamula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ligongo lyakuti mjiticisye kwapikanila AMBUJE, nombe nawo lelo jino ajiticisye kumpocela jemanja kuti mŵe ŵandu ŵawoŵawope, mpela muŵatendele cilanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
